  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fix the GO handling that corrupted identifiers and literals, support DELIMITER blocks, parameterize SQL, serialize nodes with a session scoped GET_LOCK, one transaction per changelog, async execution honouring cancellation, culture independent changelog ordering, fail fast on a missing changelog directory or an unselected database. Breaking: targets net10.0 instead of netstandard2.1, uses MySqlConnector instead of MySql.Data, and the constructor now takes Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.ILogger<MajimajiDBMYSQL> instead of Serilog.ILogger.",
